OL,3,AQantas flight grounded after bedbug
OL,4,Aoutbreak
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Qantas flight from Italy to Australia
OL,7,Fwas cancelled on Saturday, after an
OL,8,Foutbreak of bedbugs on the plane.
OL,10,FDuring the previous flight on Friday -
OL,11,Fa nearly 17-hour journey from Perth to
OL,12,FRome - some passengers had complained
OL,13,Fthat they were being bitten by bugs,
OL,14,Faccording to the Sydney Morning Herald.
OL,16,FThey were reportedly given
OL,17,Fantihistamines to help ease the itch of
OL,18,Fthe bites, but supplies ran out.
OL,20,FThe Boeing 787 Dreamliner had to be
OL,21,Fgrounded for "a deep clean", a Qantas
OL,22,Fspokesperson told the BBC.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
